SPARTA-GUI user-interface icons
===============================

The flat action/toolbar/menu icons in this directory (the freedesktop-named
*.svg files and the show-box/show-axes/emblem-photos/rotate-* rasters derived
from them) are from the Lucide icon set:

    Lucide -- https://lucide.dev
    Version: lucide-static 1.25.0
    License: ISC (see LUCIDE-LICENSE in this directory)

They were recolored to a neutral gray (#808080) that stays legible on both the
light and dark application palettes, and rasterized to PNG where a call site
still references a .png path. The file names are kept identical to the previous
icon set so no C++ call site (QIcon(":/icons/NAME.svg")) needed to change.

To regenerate after changing the mapping, see the icon_map.txt / gen_icons.sh
recipe recorded with the SPARTA-GUI port notes.

SPARTA branding art (sparta-*.png, sparta-gui-banner.png, sparta-plugin.png,
sparta-logo.svg, the hicolor/ tree, the matsci*/tutorial* gallery art, and
birch-murnaghan-eos.png) is NOT part of the Lucide set and is unchanged.
